      "text": "Dr. Uma Shankar is truly an exceptional family doctor. I can confidently say he is one of the best doctors I have ever consulted. He never suggests unnecessary tests or medicines, which builds a lot of trust and confidence as a patient.\n\nHis way of explaining health issues and treatment is outstanding. He has immense patience and listens carefully to every concern. What I personally admire the most is that he adjusts his communication based on the patient’s background, ensuring that everyone clearly understands their problem and the prescribed medication.\n\nDr. Uma Shankar’s calm nature, ethical approach, and genuine care for patients make Amaravati Family Clinic one of the most reliable clinics for family healthcare. I highly recommend him to anyone looking for an honest, knowledgeable, and compassionate family physician.",
